message: If you use HighJax in your research, please cite the BXRL paper.
title: HighJax
abstract: >-
  HighJax is an autonomous driving environment for Reinforcement Learning
  research, a JAX implementation of HighwayEnv. It includes Octane, a Rust-based
  TUI for examining experiment runs.
